cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PARSEC.py in your research, please cite the article below."
title: "PARSEC.py"
abstract: >-
  A Python-based real-space Kohn-Sham density functional theory framework that
  discretizes the Kohn-Sham equations on uniform real-space grids and supports
  machine-learned charge densities as an alternative to the superposition of
  atomic densities for initializing SCF iterations.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
